o create something that would be enticing to your potential audience and informational at the same time, thus giving your business a boost in its reach and attracting new customers.</p> <p>If you are a business owner and want to push your products, services, or information through window graphics, we are here to take on that challenge. Please feel free to call us at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or visit <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W 1B4</a> to see what and how we do it and speak about window graphic cost, materials used, etc.</p>", "style": "font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;color:var( --e-global-color-text );font-weight:400", "eid": "f3fc77f"}], "padding": "0px 0px 50px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "cc3d3c3", "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Recent Blogs", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:37px;color:var( --e-global-color-8c22d81 );font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase", "eid": "9ebdfd2"}, {"type": "cards", "cards": [{"title": "AI-Generated Decals and Lettering: Can You Really Use AI Artwork on Your Vehicle?", "href": "/ai-generated-decals-lettering-guide/", "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-31-2026-10_53_39-AM-768x403.webp", "badge": null, "alt": "AI-Generated Decals and Lettering: Can You Really Use AI Artwork on Your Vehicle?", "author": "masoud", "date": "31 August 2026", "more": "Read more »"}, {"title": "Knifeless Tape Technology: How We Wrap Your Car Without Touching the Paint", "href": "/knifeless-tape-car-wrap/", "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ChatGPT-Image-Aug-28-2026-12_07_06-PM-768x403.webp", "badge": null, "alt": "Knifeless Tape Wraps: Perfect Edges, Zero Paint Damage", "author": "masoud", "date": "29 August 2026", "more":